  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Britanniae</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "Britannia I or Britannia Prima was a province of the Roman empire that was established under the Diocletianic reforms of the third century. The capital of the province remains undetermined but the province was mostly likely centered in the present regions of Wales and Cornwall.",
